OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 89, dies after crash between
OL,4,Atwo cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 89-year-old man has died after a
OL,7,Fcrash between two cars.
OL,9,FThe man, from Bristol, was in a black
OL,10,FSkoda Fabia which was involved in a
OL,11,Fcollision with a blue Mini Countryman
OL,12,Fon the A433 Bath Road near Westonbirt
OL,13,Fin the Cotswolds on 13 October.
OL,15,FHe was taken to Southmead Hospital but
OL,16,Fdied the following day, Gloucestershire
OL,17,FPolice confirmed this weekend.
OL,19,FA man in his 30s who was driving the
OL,20,FMini was taken to Gloucestershire Royal
OL,21,FHospital with minor injuries and has
OL,22,Fsince been discharged.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
